          <h3>Introductions and fees</h3>
          <p>
            An <strong>introduction</strong> is our supply of a candidate's details to you in any
            form — resume, profile, verbal or written referral. An <strong>engagement</strong> is
            your employment of that candidate in any capacity, permanent or contract, whether or
            not for the role we introduced them for.
