            <strong>12 months</strong> of the introduction, the fee is payable even if the
            engagement is for a different role, in a different division, or arranged after our
            work on that vacancy ended. The same applies if you pass the candidate's details to
            another organisation and they engage them.
          </p>
          <h3>Replacement period</h3>
          <p>
            If a permanently placed candidate leaves or is dismissed for cause within
            <strong>90 days</strong> of their start date, we will search for a replacement at no
            further fee, provided your invoice is paid in full and you notify us in writing within
            14 days of their departure. The replacement period does not apply where the role is
            made redundant, the role's scope changes materially, or the departure follows a
            failure to pay the candidate as agreed.
          </p>
          <h3>What we need from you</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>An accurate brief — the real role, the real salary range, the real requirements.</li>
            <li>Notice, promptly, when a role is filled, paused or withdrawn.</li>
            <li>Confirmation of an engagement within 7 days of an offer being accepted.</li>
            <li>Compliance with employment and anti-discrimination law in your hiring decisions. We will not screen candidates on any protected characteristic, whoever asks.</li>
